  "question": {
    "text": "For $\\lambda>0$, let $\\theta$ be the angle between the vectors $\\vec{a}=\\hat{i}+\\lambda \\hat{j}-3 \\hat{k}$ and $\\vec{b}=3 \\hat{i}-\\hat{j}+2 \\hat{k}$. If the vectors $\\vec{a}+\\vec{b}$ and $\\vec{a}-\\vec{b}$ are mutually perpendicular, then the value of (14 cos $\\theta)^2$ is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
